+## 2024-09-19 - Extracted lowercased search query from filter mapping
+**Learning:** React component search inputs triggering full list filtering on every keystroke can compute the lowercased search string repeatedly (N * 3 times where N is array length) if the `toLowerCase()` call on the query is placed inside the filter predicate loop.
+**Action:** Always hoist invariant string transformations (like lowercasing the search query) outside of mapping or filtering callbacks to save string allocation and execution time.
